_shrink":null,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.10252513821979373,"_gp_sbc_dilution":false,"_score_sbc_dilution":0.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.082550004,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":55.0,"_gate_insider_buying":0.0,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":0.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"Avidbank Holdings, Inc. operates as a bank holding company for Avidbank that provides financial solutions and services. It offers business and personal deposit products, such as checking, money market, and savings accounts; and certificates of deposit. The company also provides lending products, including working capital lines of credit, equipment loans, acquisition financing, shareholder buyouts, ESOP loans, and owner-occupied real estate loans; sponsor finance comprising acquisition term loans, recapitalization term loans, and working capital lines; and venture lending, such as venture debt, growth capital, recurring revenue, and treasury management services. In addition, it offers commercial real estate lending consisting of permanent loans and bridge financing products; Asset-Based Lending that includes Borrowing Base and ABL term loans; and construction lending products, including land acquisition loans, construction spec SFD, owner-occupied SFD, condominiums, subdivision, unsecured business lines, pre-development loans, real estate bridge loans, and RLOC \u0096 real estate secured loans. Further, the company provides private equity and venture capital financing solutions; structure finance; security and fraud prevention services; domestic and international wires, ACH origination, corporate credit cards, bill pay, trade finance letters of credit, and zero balance account; remote deposit capture, ACH collections, incoming wires, lockbox, and merchant services; and online banking real time fraud mitigation tools, check positive pay, and ACH positive pay. Additionally, it offers ATM/debit cards, credit cards, business courier, and complimentary notary services, as well as online and mobile banking services. The company was founded in 2003 and is headquartered in San Jose, California.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Mark D. Mordell | Chairman & CEO | Age 65 | Compensation: $1.2M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 171 people. Revenue per employee of $181K ranks in the bottom quartile among Financial Services peers. Each employee generates $228K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $19K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 7\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (8/10).","financial_summary":["Avidbank Holdings, Inc. is a small-cap financial services business with a $378M market cap on $31M of annual revenue.","Returns on capital run at -15% against a 7% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The business throws off $39M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 126 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","On the balance sheet, thin -0.5\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 10% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 8.3% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.1) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Operating margins 116% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Trading near 52-week highs \u2014 the market has already recognised the story","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.10888331940963478},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $2.2M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 73% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Analyzing Avidbank (NASDAQ:AVBH) and Commercial Bancgroup (NASDAQ:CBK)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/10/28/analyzing-avidbank-nasdaqavbh-and-commercial-bancgroup-nasdaqcbk.html","date":"2026-10-28","timestamp":1793205140.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.945,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Avidbank (NASDAQ:AVBH) Announces Earnings Results","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/10/28/avidbank-nasdaqavbh-announces-earnings-results.html","date":"2026-10-28","timestamp":1793195839.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.772,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Avidbank Holdings (AVBH) Stock Climbs As Q3 Earnings Revive Profitability","sourc